  b.summary(f'CMI due to SMA atherosclerosis was diagnosed. Vascular surgery referral led to successful percutaneous angioplasty/stenting, with patent SMA and good distal filling on completion angiography. At {follow} she had regained approximately {gain} kg and post-prandial pain resolved; the report describes full GI symptom resolution.',[dx,refer,angio,stent,patent,regained,painresolved,full])
  cap='b00024' if i==1 else 'b00025'
