 b.limits+=['No exact original-CT dates or stenosis percentages provided. Initial GI workups described as unrevealing do not establish specific excluded disorders.','No explicit same-patient prior-report links found; cited delayed-CMI case reports are external literature. No genetic/family linkage between these two index patients inferred.','Only source-described follow-up at11months/6months retained; no stent brand, antiplatelet regimen or later outcomes reported.']
